      "fileName": "oversized-throw.json",
      "id": "tIE2umG4rQOxm8D8",
      "name": "Oversized Throw",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "tIE2umG4rQOxm8D8",
        "folder": "BYCNizFJdYZq0Uf6",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Oversized Throw",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You have one or more hands free.</p><hr /><p>With a great heave, you seize a piece of your surroundings, such as a boulder, log, table, wagon, or chunk of earth, and hurl it at your foes. The object must be your size or one size smaller than you, and it must not have too much Bulk for you to lift it in the first place. Make a ranged Strike with the object; regardless of the result, the object takes the same amount of damage it would deal on a success.</p>\n<p>The object is a simple ranged weapon that deals 1d10 bludgeoning damage, has a range increment of 20 feet, and has the thrown weapon trait. The damage increases to 2d10 bludgeoning damage if you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Weapon Specialization] in simple weapons, or 3d10 bludgeoning if you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Greater Weapon Specialization (Barbarian)]{Greater Weapon Specialization}.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "selfEffect": {
            "name": "Effect: Oversized Throw",
            "uuid": "Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Oversized Throw"
          },
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "barbarian",
              "rage"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "raging-athlete.json",
      "id": "sEWYOllJ6rYoXK4K",
      "name": "Raging Athlete",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "sEWYOllJ6rYoXK4K",
        "folder": "BYCNizFJdYZq0Uf6",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Raging Athlete",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Physical obstacles can't hold back your fury. While you are raging, you gain a climb Speed and swim Speed equal to your land Speed, the DC of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.High Jump]{High Jumps} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Long Jump]{Long Jumps} decreases by 10, and you increase your distance on a successful Long Jump by 10 feet. Your distance for a vertical @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Leap] increases to 5 feet vertically, and your distance for a horizontal Leap increases to 15 feet if your Speed is at least 15 feet, and to 20 feet if your Speed is at least 30 feet.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 4
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "expert in Athletics"
              }
            ]
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "key": "BaseSpeed",
              "predicate": [
                "self:effect:rage"
              ],
              "selector": "climb",
              "value": "@actor.system.movement.speeds.land.value"
            },
            {
              "key": "BaseSpeed",
              "predicate": [
                "self:effect:rage"
              ],
              "selector": "swim",
              "value": "@actor.system.movement.speeds.land.value"
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "barbarian"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 4,
      "category": "class"
    },
